&lt;p&gt;时间过得真快，一眨眼2025年就翻篇了。回头看这一年，算不上顺风顺水，甚至有些磕磕绊绊。身体不怎么给力，重感冒犯了两回，眼睛不舒服也缠了好几个月。人际关系也起起落落，有突如其来的温暖，也有体面说再见的时刻，还有些人和事，走着走着散了，再也不见。日子里的悲欢离合，偶尔也会让我矫情几句，但静下心来想，比起生死大事，这些都不值一提，早晚会成为过眼云烟。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>AI重塑教师</title><link>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/xuexi/ai2/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Nov 2025 15:13:27 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/xuehai/xuexi/ai2/</guid><description>&lt;/br&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Categories&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;  Computer Vision: Enables machines to make sense of visual content such as images and videos&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt; Natural Language Processing: Enables machines to understand and generate human language&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt; Recommendation System: A system that recommends content (such as products, videos, and so on) that users are interested in&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt; Embodied Intelligence: Enables AI systems to interact with the environment by integrating physical entities (such as robots)&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Core Process of AI (from Data to Prediction) A simple process&lt;/br&gt;1. Train the model with historical data &lt;/br&gt;2. Input new data into the trained model&lt;/br&gt; 3. The model completes the prediction and derives the unknown attributes of the data&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Key Elements of AI To implement AI, three core components are needed:&lt;/br&gt;  Model: An algorithmic framework for processing data and completing tasks &lt;/br&gt; Data: The "raw material" for training and validating the model  Computing Power Platform: Hardware resources that support model training and running&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Concepts Related to ChatGPT&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Meaning of GPT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;  G → Generative (Generative, capable of generating text, images, and so forth)&lt;/br&gt;  P → Pre-trained (Pre-trained, the model first undergoes basic training on vast amounts of data) &lt;/br&gt; T → Transformer (A deep learning architecture based on the "attention mechanism", which is the core technology of large models)&lt;/br&gt;  Model Training Process: Pre-training → Post-training (Fine-tuning, to adapt the model to specific tasks)&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Core Elements of Large Models&lt;/br&gt;  Technical Support: Large Model + Big Data + Big Computing ("Three Bigs" form the foundation of large models)&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Functions of Large Models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/br&gt;  Dialogue, Consultation (Analysis of Experience Outcomes) &lt;/br&gt; Legal, Writing (Technical Reports, Academic Papers), Document Processing, Drawing&lt;/br&gt;  Video Generation (such as Sora), Audio Generation, and the breakthrough of "seeing is believing" rather than "hearing is deceitful"&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Working Principle&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/br&gt; Core Logic: NTP (Next Token Prediction, "Next Token Prediction", where the model generates coherent text by predicting subsequent content)&lt;/br&gt;  Common Problems of ChatGPT&lt;/br&gt;  Advantages For advantages, see the figure below&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/br&gt;
&lt;img src="https://cccimg.com/view.php/2ae4c334aa708d7b946ac37b31055e00.png" alt="全屏图片"&gt;&lt;/br&gt;
&lt;P&gt; Disadvantages: Low reliability, proneness to forgetting, poor timeliness (as it only possesses knowledge from a single training phase), and lack of full consciousness&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;strong&gt; 3. Prospects and Impacts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/br&gt;  Code Development  Replace Some Jobs: Translation, Customer Service, Accounting, Pan-entertainment Industry, Social Media Industry, Education Industry&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;strong&gt; 4. Prompt Engineering Skills&lt;/strong&gt; For prompt engineering skills, see the figure below&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/br&gt;
&lt;img src="https://cccimg.com/view.php/96ed00b4fa0049962e596814479b5b9d.png" alt="全屏图片"&gt;
&lt;img src="https://cccimg.com/view.php/26bb2478eaae6ac0831e66040b89fdc0.png" alt="全屏图片"&gt;
